{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f) =$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-descending-property-smooth}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:365d02bf050f12ee9903b36c61bdf624d00b07c1586052591e25ad225aaf043e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9ace9c60d4a5c9d8860d71585bc448170ea2f0a0d9542c6cc2ccf78f393d2c42", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is smooth''\nis fpqc local on the base.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:01c0cead52135e588205e43ea10e7f0ec03023ccbd006fd8ffefb8c514d64f20", "unit_id": "tag:02VL:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "02YJ", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-flat}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-descending-property-locally-finite-presentation}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-set-points-where-fibres-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3246eb0e8bb77086d37ae6153a93246b892cecba0d8e33a9ad92f004b8523253", "source_text": "A morphism is smooth if and only if it is locally of finite presentation,\nflat, and has smooth fibres. We have seen\nalready that being flat and locally of finite presentation are\nfpqc local on the base (Lemmas\n<REF_0001>, and\n<REF_0002>).\nHence the result follows for smooth from\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a6ec94d0893ecfd18573b406681e6a1c7ba3e312fc32e242b3b73c54ed2651d6", "unit_id": "tag:02VL:proof"}
